%% Late Pickup Radar: trip workflow (events, states, where each timestamp can be trusted)
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> requested: request_datetime
    requested --> on_scene: wait (driver en route)
    on_scene --> picked_up: dwell = pickup - on_scene
    requested --> picked_up: no captured arrival (R13 / R09)
    picked_up --> dropped_off: trip_minutes = trip_time / 60
    dropped_off --> [*]

    note right of requested
        KPI wait = pickup - request (A01)
        R12: on_scene before request means a
        pre-arranged ride, so the row leaves wait metrics
    end note
    note right of on_scene
        Present only where on_scene < pickup.
        Uber writes pickup into on_scene on 6.6% of trips
        (R13): no arrival event, not a fake one.
    end note
    note right of dropped_off
        Duration from trip_time; the dropoff
        timestamp is flagged when it disagrees (R02, R07)
    end note
